    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ensure that the high-risk AI system complies with accessibility requirements in accordance with Directives (EU) 2016/2102 and (EU) 2019/882</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Providers must ensure their high-risk AI systems comply with accessibility requirements in accordance with specific EU Directives.</skos:definition>
