  <aiact:Obligation rdf:about="https://w3id.org/aiact-poc#CarryOutDataProtectionImpactAssessment">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">carry out a data protection impact assessment under Article 35 of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 or Article 27 of Directive (EU) 2016/680</rdfs:label>
    <aiact:sourceQuote>Where applicable, deployers of high-risk AI systems shall use the information provided under Article 13 of this Regulation to comply with their obligation to carry out a data protection impact assessment under Article 35 of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 or Article 27 of Directive (EU) 2016/680.</aiact:sourceQuote>
