    <aiact:articleRef>Annex III(6)</aiact:articleRef>
    <aiact:sourceQuote>Law enforcement, in so far as their use is permitted under relevant Union or national law:</aiact:sourceQuote>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An area where AI systems are high-risk, covering law enforcement uses such as victim and offending risk assessment, polygraphs, evaluation of the reliability of evidence, and the profiling of natural persons.</skos:definition>
  </owl:NamedIndividual>
