    <aiact:hasLegalSource rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1689/art_55/oj"/>
    <aiact:sourceQuote>keep track of, document, and report, without undue delay, to the AI Office and, as appropriate, to national competent authorities, relevant information about serious incidents and possible corrective measures to address them</aiact:sourceQuote>
