    <aiact:curationStatus>accepted</aiact:curationStatus>
    <aiact:articleRef>Art. 5(1)(h)</aiact:articleRef>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The use of 'real-time' remote biometric identification systems in publicly accessible spaces for the purposes of law enforcement, unless and in so far as such use is strictly necessary for one of the following objectives.</skos:definition>
